direction: down
semantic: "Retain Gambit Scheme authority\nObject identity / equality / discovery order\nExisting ordered tables, vectors and queues"
freeze: "Immutable semantic revision\nDeclared dense IDs + counts + validated references\nNo raw movable Scheme addresses"
handoff: "Choose handoff independently of language\nHT1 per-record / HT2 bounded batches / HT3 snapshot\nConversion + ownership + prefix failure + close obligations"
native: "One common native physical planner\nC or Zig implementation\nNo duplicate semantic interning; no required resident source sum"
outputs: "Shared physical decisions\nC output + native / MLIR-LLVM provider\nRuntime publication / roots / control remain explicit"
scope: "Version boundary\nExplicit C-facing schema / lengths / ownership / status\nHide native containers and Zig library types\nCharge translation, SDK and provider requalification"
account: "Fair accounting\nMatch handoff and capabilities before cancelling common work\nLower crossing count is a shared transport gain\nOne reusable generator is not maintained per generated field"
decision: "Label slice alone does not justify Zig adoption\nShared contract reconstruction remains valuable\nTG5 not passed; no implementation or native tests" {
  style.fill: "#fff0ce"
}
semantic -> freeze
freeze -> handoff
handoff -> native
native -> outputs
native -> scope
outputs -> account
scope -> account
account -> decision
